
== the git container
user nonroot, read-only true, cap_drop [ALL], [no-new-privileges:true], memory 1073741824, ports {}
networks: shinanop_git; internal: true
members of shinanop_git: shinanop-git-1 shinanop-web-1 shinanop-worker-1 
environment (names only):  HOST INTERNAL_HOST INTERNAL_PORT NODE_ENV PATH PORT SHINAN_CATALOG_DIR SHINAN_GIT_SERVICE_TOKEN_FILE SSL_CERT_FILE 

== the service token
from the git network, no token: 401
from the git network, a wrong token: 401
from the git network, the token: 404
from Caddy's network (shinanop_proxy): 000

